notes: "CustomVoice clones from a reference clip; VoiceDesign builds a voice from a
  description. 1.92 B parameters, and the codec is 0.17 B at 12 Hz -- twelve tokens a
  second, where most neural codecs run 25 to 75. The autoregressive stage does not
  compile for a dataflow part and runs on the host."
